ld></p><p>In the print version of the article listed above, the affiliation for A.B. is incorrect. The correct affiliation is as follows: Bethanien Hospital, Geriatrics Centre at the University of Heidelberg, and the Robert Bosch Foundation, Stuttgart, Germany. The online version reflects these changes.</p></body></article>